{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SwOkXFDafe1792982830.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>凌晨前往新皇崗口岸港方大樓，一度再有交通擠塞情況。</p><p></p><p>由香港前往皇崗，連續第二晚出現塞車。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.MK-0130_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202680maBDsmWu1792964728.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>警方凌晨零時許在社交平台指，前往新皇崗口岸港方大樓的交通非常繁忙。由於大量旅客正使用不同交通工具前往該處，連接道路出現交通擠塞，正實施人群及交通管制措施。車輛平均須輪候約25分鐘方可抵達口岸落客區。到凌晨零時50分，新皇崗跨境車輛流量已回復正常。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.MK-0130_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026VGPufPHlMU1792964726.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>在旺角直通巴車站，凌晨零時有約30人排隊上車，秩序良好。政府表示，相關跨境巴士營辦商已為觀看演唱會的內地旅客安排預先售票，並安排了63部及48部跨境巴士分別前往皇崗和深圳灣口岸，以應付需求。營辦商有足夠車輛，可按售票情況再增加班次。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:41.200034+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":285,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T21:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:58:07.070277+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:25.879409+00:00","content_hash":"73593b37a296e99f81a435336146af5ae040fa0f1bf20062675d997c829b20ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:41.200034+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}